=== layout: four-panels

# 14. From corn to the gas tank

@top-left

## Starch

Corn and other starch crops supply stored carbohydrate.

@top-right

## Sugar

Enzymes hydrolyze starch into fermentable sugars.

@bottom-left

## Ethanol

Fermentation converts sugar into ethanol and CO2.

@bottom-right

## Fuel

Recover ethanol, remove water, and blend it for the intended engine.

@notes

