=== layout: one-panel

# 14. Food, fuel, and the whole calculation

@body

- Which starch crops are used? What enzymes and process improvements reduce costs or increase yield?
- Compare energy per gallon with gasoline, then include farming, fertilizer, processing, and transport.
- What else comes out of an ethanol plant? How do coproducts affect the food-versus-fuel calculation?
- Can you find ethanol-free gasoline in Illinois? Check an actual station, its fuel grade, and the date instead of assuming every pump is the same.

@notes

