=== layout: one-panel

# 15. What has to work?

@body

{column-widths="1,3"}
| Step | The problem to solve |
| --- | --- |
| Feedstock | Collect bulky material without excessive cost |
| Pretreatment | Expose fibers without making too many inhibitors |
| Hydrolysis | Make enough accessible sugar with affordable enzymes |
| Fermentation | Use mixed sugars and tolerate the process conditions |

@notes

