=== layout: one-panel

# 16. The reaction is only the beginning

@body

| Part of the process | What can go wrong? |
| --- | --- |
| Oil or fat | Water and free fatty acids complicate processing |
| Catalyst and methanol | Side reactions and incomplete conversion |
| Separation and purification | Residual alcohol, catalyst, soap, or glycerol |
| Finished fuel | Cold-flow, storage, and engine compatibility |

@notes

