# 16. Would you put it in your engine?

@body

- Compare base, acid, and enzyme catalysts. Which feedstocks make each approach attractive?
- How do you separate glycerol and purify the FAME? What fuel-quality measurements matter?
- Compare B20 with B100. Check the engine manufacturer and fuel standard before assuming compatibility.
- Which emissions change, under which operating conditions? What can industry do with the glycerol byproduct?

@notes

