| xDNA | Expanded nucleobases | How does a wider pair fit a helix? |
| HNA | Anhydrohexitol sugar unit | Can an engineered enzyme copy it? |
| Other XNAs | Other sugar/backbone choices | Which partners and enzymes work? |

@notes

