# Topic 19: Artificial cells

@body

- How much of a cell can we build from parts?
- [*Bottom-up*]{underline=true}: assemble molecules into a cell-like system. *Top-down*: simplify an existing living cell.
- A membrane bag can hold reactions. That alone does not make it alive.
- Which jobs must the system carry out for itself, and which jobs are we doing for it?

@notes

