=== layout: four-panels

# 19. What does your cell need?

@top-left

## A boundary

Lipid vesicle, polymer compartment, or other enclosure. Materials must still enter and leave.

@top-right

## Energy and chemistry

Supply energy, make needed molecules, and handle waste.

@bottom-left

## Information

Store, copy, and use instructions. Can the system make its own working parts?

@bottom-right

## Growth and division

Grow the boundary and contents, then distribute them to daughter compartments.

@notes

