# 20. Connect the two halves

@top-left

## Light

Thylakoid membranes capture light energy.

@top-right

## Energy carriers

ATP and NADPH connect light reactions to downstream chemistry.

@bottom-left

## Carbon fixation

A designed enzyme cycle incorporates CO2 into organic molecules.

@bottom-right

## Keep it running

Balance rates, replace damaged parts, supply inputs, and recover products.

